0485b1_control"><audio loop="" preload="none"></audio><button type="button" class="k_e0485b1_toggle " aria-pressed="false" aria-label="音乐尚未接入，查看说明"><svg class="k_e0485b1_wave" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="17" height="17" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8v4M7 4v12M11 6v8M15 3v14M19 8v4"></path></svg><span>音乐 关</span></button><button type="button" class="k_e0485b1_settings" aria-label="音量与曲目信息" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_7a_-panel"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="15" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3v14M15 3v14M2 7h6M12 13h6"></path></svg></button></div><select class="k_554b53f_select" aria-label="切换网站语言"><option value="zh" lang="zh-CN" selected="">中文</option><option value="en" lang="en">EN</option><option value="ja" lang="ja">日本語</option></select><button type="button" class="k_45aaab5_menuToggle " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-navigation-menu" aria-label="打开导航菜单"><span>菜单</span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6h16M2 13h16"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main class="kagura-collection-page"><div class="k_72a5680_root" lang="zh-CN"><section class="k_72a5680_intro" aria-labelledby="brand-title"><div class="k_72a5680_introTop"><span>艺术 · 个人 IP · 收藏作品</span><span>KIKORA / 正在生长的世界</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_heroGrid"><div class="k_72a5680_heroCopy"><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">为动漫、游戏与潮流文化中的收藏者</p><h1 id="brand-title" lang="en">COLLECT<br/>YOUR<br/><span>WORLD.</span></h1><h2>让创作者的世界，<br/>成为你的收藏。</h2><p class="k_72a5680_heroDescription">从个人 IP 的想象，到可以触碰的限定作品。<br/>我们正在构想，一个由画师与玩家共同丰富的 KIKORA。</p><div class="k_72a5680_heroActions"><a href="#manifesto">走进我们的世界<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><a href="#creators">画师共创计划<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><div class="k_72a5680_heroCollage" aria-label="KIKORA 艺术与收藏品设计研究"><div class="k_72a5680_collageGrid" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="k_72a5680_collageCoordinates">画作 → 物件 → 收藏</span><figure class="k_72a5680_heroWraith"><div><img alt="恶灵角色视觉研究，冷蓝色人物与空间构图" sizes="(max-width:760px) 57vw, 32vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-wraith.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchPriority="high"/></div><figcaption><span>01 / 视觉研究</span><span>VOID FM.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="k_72a5680_heroReyna"><div><img alt="蕾娜角色视觉研究，红色与紫蓝色的专辑风肖像" sizes="(max-width:760px) 50vw, 27vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-reyna.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchPriority="high"/></div><figcaption><span>02 / 封面研究</span><span>STARPLAYER.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="k_72a5680_heroKeys"><div><img alt="蕾娜连续印花键帽设计概念" sizes="(max-width:760px) 52vw, 25vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-kagura-keycaps-cover.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>作品的另一种形态。<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></figcaption></figure><div class="k_72a5680_collageSeal" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="" viewBox="8 4 112 112" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18 52 64 22 108 39 89 52 66 43 38 61 38 90 18 82Z"></path><path d="M66 76 90 60 110 68 66 97Z" opacity=".55"></path><path d="M48 69v21l18 7v-21Z" opacity=".83"></path></svg><small lang="en">IMAGINE.<br/>CREATE.<br/>COLLECT.</small></div></div></div><div class="k_72a5680_introBottom"><a href="#manifesto">故事，从这里开始<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><p>页面作品为视觉与产品概念研究，非已发布画师联名。</p><span>独立的世界 / 相通的热爱</span></div></section><section id="manifesto" class="k_72a5680_manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title"><div class="k_72a5680_manifestoSide"><span class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">KIKORA 的起点</span><span class="k_72a5680_sectionIndex">[ 01 — 03 ]</span></div><div><h2 id="manifesto-title">有些热爱，<br/>值得拥有<span>真实的形状。</span></h2><div class="k_72a5680_manifestoCopy"><p>我们喜欢一个角色，常常是因为看见了自己；我们收藏一件作品，是想把那份共鸣留得更久。KIKORA 从这样的热爱出发。</p><p>我们希望连接全国独立画师与个人 IP 创作者，以玻璃鼠标垫、键帽和金属客制化探索限定艺术作品。让创作有新的去处，也让玩家的收藏有更多自己的样子。</p></div></div></section><section id="our-story" class="k_72a5680_story" aria-label="从创作到收藏的三个章节"><div class="k_72a5680_pinned"><div class="k_72a5680_storyTop"><span>从画师的世界，走进你的世界。</span><div class="k_72a5680_chapterNav" aria-label="叙事章节"><button type="button" aria-label="查看第 1 章" aria-current="step">01<i></i></button><button type="button" aria-label="查看第 2 章">02<i></i></button><button type="button" aria-label="查看第 3 章">03<i></i></button></div></div><div class="k_72a5680_chapters"><article id="story-chapter-0" class="k_72a5680_chapter" data-active="true"><div class="k_72a5680_chapterCopy"><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">01<!-- --> / <!-- -->ONE ARTIST. ONE WORLD.</p><h2>一个画师，<br/>一个世界。</h2><p class="k_72a5680_description">鲜明的角色、独特的画风、持续生长的故事。我们期待与独立画师及个人 IP 创作者一起，让他们的世界拥有新的收藏形态。</p><span class="k_72a5680_chapterNote">从个人表达出发 / CREATOR FIRST</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_chapterVisual undefined" aria-hidden="true"><div class="k_72a5680_artistFrame"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width:760px) 60vw, 35vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-reyna.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="k_72a5680_artistSlip"><span>创作者的<br/>独特宇宙</span><p>角色<br/>风格<br/>故事</p><i>原点，是独一无二的表达。</i></div><span class="k_72a5680_visualCaption">视觉研究 / 个人表达</span></div></article><article id="story-chapter-1" class="k_72a5680_chapter" data-active="false"><div class="k_72a5680_chapterCopy"><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">02<!-- --> / <!-- -->ART TAKES FORM.</p><h2>把作品，做成<br/>值得收藏的实物。</h2><p class="k_72a5680_description">完整铺开的玻璃画面，排列成章的键帽，金属的轮廓与质感。我们希望与创作者一起，让每种材质成为作品的一次重新表达。</p><span class="k_72a5680_chapterNote">从画面到物件 / ART INTO OBJECTS</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_chapterVisual undefined" aria-hidden="true"><div class="k_72a5680_materialPhoto"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width:760px) 85vw, 48vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-kagura-keycaps-cover.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="k_72a5680_materialSwatches"><span>玻璃<i></i></span><span>键帽<i></i></span><span>金属<i></i></span></div><span class="k_72a5680_visualCaption">同一个创作世界，不同的呈现方式。</span></div></article><article id="story-chapter-2" class="k_72a5680_chapter" data-active="false"><div class="k_72a5680_chapterCopy"><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">03<!-- --> / <!-- -->LIVE WITH YOUR COLLECTION.</p><h2>让收藏，<br/>进入你的日常。</h2><p class="k_72a5680_description">为一个角色、一种画风、一份共鸣而收藏。把你认同的世界留在桌面，让每次游戏与创作，都有它的陪伴。</p><span class="k_72a5680_chapterNote">因热爱而收藏 / MADE PERSONAL</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_chapterVisual undefined" aria-hidden="true"><div class="k_72a5680_collectorArt"><img alt="" sizes="(max-width:760px) 64vw, 35vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-wraith.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="k_72a5680_collectorLabel"><span>KIKORA / 收藏笔记</span><strong>为你<br/>热爱的<br/>世界。</strong><p>为热爱留下位置。<br/>也为新的故事留下位置。</p><div>艺术 × 游戏 × 日常</div></div><span class="k_72a5680_visualCaption">你的收藏，你的视角。</span></div></article></div><div class="k_72a5680_storyBottom"><span>想象。共创。收藏。</span><div class="k_72a5680_progress" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div><a href="#creators">下一个章节<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></div></div></section><section id="creators" class="k_72a5680_creators" aria-labelledby="creators-title"><div class="k_72a5680_creatorsHeading"><div><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">KIKORA 画师共创计划</p><h2 id="creators-title">下一件值得收藏的作品，<br/>也许来自<span>你的世界。</span></h2></div><span class="k_72a5680_planStatus"><i></i>首批画师共创计划 · 筹备中</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_creatorGrid"><div class="k_72a5680_creatorPoster"><span>致独立创作者的<br/>一份邀请</span><strong lang="en">YOUR IP.<br/>OUR NEXT<br/><em>CHAPTER.</em></strong><p>独立画师 / 原创角色 / 个人 IP<br/>从任何一座城市，带来属于你的世界。</p><div class="k_72a5680_posterArt" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="k_72a5680_posterFoot">共创，从你的表达开始。</span></div><div class="k_72a5680_principles"><article><span>01</span><div><p>CREATOR FIRST</p><h3>让创作者被看见。</h3><p>我们希望每次合作都保留清晰的画师署名，呈现个人 IP 的故事与表达。</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><p>CREATED TOGETHER</p><h3>共同创作完整的系列。</h3><p>从主题、构图到材质和实物呈现，与创作者一起打磨作品走出画布后的样子。</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><p>LIMITED, WITH CLARITY</p><h3>让限量有清楚的依据。</h3><p>限定作品计划在正式发售前公开版数与再版规则。当前展示为设计研究，尚未发售。</p></div></article><a class="k_72a5680_creatorCta" href="mailto:support@kikoragear.com?subject=KIKORA+%E7%94%BB%E5%B8%88%E5%85%B1%E5%88%9B%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C&amp;body=%E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD+KIKORA%EF%BC%8C%0A%0A%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E7%A7%B0%E5%91%BC%EF%BC%9A%0A%E4%BD%9C%E5%93%81%E9%9B%86%E6%88%96%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA+IP+%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5%EF%BC%9A%0A%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91%EF%BC%9A%0A%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%0A"><span>聊聊你的作品<!-- --> <small>开启一段共创对话</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><p class="k_72a5680_creatorDisclaimer">共创方式、授权范围与作品发行方案将在具体合作中确认。当前概念图用于表达设计方向，尚未公布合作画师名单。</p></section><section id="discover" class="k_72a5680_discover" aria-labelledby="discover-title"><div class="k_72a5680_discoverHeading"><div><p class="k_72a5680_eyebrow">探索作品的不同形态</p><h2 id="discover-title" lang="en">A WORLD.<br/><span>MANY FORMS.</span></h2></div><p>同一份热爱，可以有不同的收藏形态。<br/>选择一个入口，走近正在成形的作品。</p></div><div class="k_72a5680_categories"><article class="k_72a5680_category"><a class="k_72a5680_categoryVisual" aria-label="探索玻璃鼠标垫" href="/pages/glass"><div class="k_72a5680_glassStudy"><img alt="恶灵玻璃鼠标垫设计研究" sizes="(max-width:760px) 60vw, 26vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-wraith.webp' | asset